§ `Article 80(4): the provider brings the AI system into compliance within the period, or is subject to fines`

-- src:1319 | 4. The provider shall ensure that all necessary action is taken to bring the AI system into compliance with the requirements and obligations laid down in this Regulation. Where the provider of an AI system concerned does not bring the AI system into compliance with those requirements and obligations within the period referred to in paragraph 2 of this Article, the provider shall be subject to fines in accordance with Article 99.
@ref Art 80(4) (src:1319)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the market surveillance authority has required the provider to act under Article 80(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider has brought the AI system into compliance within the period referred to in Article 80(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 80(4) the provider is subject to fines in accordance with Article 99` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 80 to 98 and 101 and 112 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the AI system`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Article 113 gives this provision its date of application, and Article 111(2) may save the system; before that nothing is owed
    ELSE IF NOT `the market surveillance authority has required the provider to act under Article 80(2)`
         THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the sentence speaks of "the period referred to in paragraph 2", which exists only once the authority has required action
         ELSE IF `the provider has brought the AI system into compliance within the period referred to in Article 80(2)`
              THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where the provider of an AI system concerned does not bring the AI system into compliance with those requirements and obligations within the period referred to in paragraph 2 of this Article, the provider shall be subject to fines" (a "where" condition that is not met)
              ELSE JUST TRUE

-- The deadline of the first sentence is the period the authority prescribes in paragraph 2 ("within a period the market
-- surveillance authority may prescribe"). The caller states the day the period began and the day it ends.
@ref Art 80(4)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the market surveillance authority has required the provider to act under Article 80(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the day on which the period prescribed under Article 80(2) began` IS A DATE
      `the day on which the period prescribed under Article 80(2) ends` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Art 80 party` `Art 80 act`
`Art 80(4) the duty of the provider to bring the AI system into compliance` MEANS
    IF       `Arts 80 to 98 and 101 and 112 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the AI system`
         AND `the market surveillance authority has required the provider to act under Article 80(2)`
    THEN PARTY `Art 80 the provider`
         MUST `Art 80(4) ensure that all necessary action is taken to bring the AI system into compliance`
         WITHIN (Day `the day on which the period prescribed under Article 80(2) ends`) MINUS (Day `the day on which the period prescribed under Article 80(2) began`)
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY `Art 80 the provider` BECAUSE "the AI system was not brought into compliance within the period referred to in Article 80(2), so the provider is subject to fines in accordance with Article 99"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on these facts

§ `Article 80(5): corrective action in respect of all the AI systems concerned`

-- src:1320 | 5. The provider shall ensure that all appropriate corrective action is taken in respect of all the AI systems concerned that it has made available on the Union market.
@ref Art 80(5) (src:1320)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the market surveillance authority has required the provider to act under Article 80(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the number of the AI systems concerned that the provider has made available on the Union market` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of those AI systems in respect of which appropriate corrective action has been taken` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 80(5) the provider has ensured that all appropriate corrective action is taken` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 80 to 98 and 101 and 112 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the AI system`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Article 113 gives this provision its date of application, and Article 111(2) may save the system; before that nothing is owed
    ELSE IF NOT `the market surveillance authority has required the provider to act under Article 80(2)`
         THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "the AI systems concerned" are the systems the procedure of this Article concerns, which the authority's requirement under paragraph 2 starts (fork F-80-5)
         ELSE IF `the number of those AI systems in respect of which appropriate corrective action has been taken` AT LEAST `the number of the AI systems concerned that the provider has made available on the Union market`
              THEN JUST TRUE
              ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The provider shall ensure that all appropriate corrective action is taken in respect of all the AI systems concerned" (a bare "shall" not done: taken case by case, fork F-bare-must)

-- The duty itself: it arises with the authority's requirement and has no time limit and no stated consequence of its own.
@ref Art 80(5)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the market surveillance authority has required the provider to act under Article 80(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Art 80 party` `Art 80 act`
`Art 80(5) the duty of the provider to ensure corrective action in respect of all the AI systems concerned` MEANS
    IF       `Arts 80 to 98 and 101 and 112 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the AI system`
         AND `the market surveillance authority has required the provider to act under Article 80(2)`
    THEN PARTY `Art 80 the provider`
         MUST `Art 80(5) ensure that all appropriate corrective action is taken in respect of all the AI systems concerned`
         HENCE FULFILLED
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on these facts

