§ `Article 80(7): misclassification in order to circumvent Chapter III, Section 2`

-- src:1322 | 7. Where, in the course of the evaluation pursuant to paragraph 1 of this Article, the market surveillance authority establishes that the AI system was misclassified by the provider as non-high-risk in order to circumvent the application of requirements in Chapter III, Section 2, the provider shall be subject to fines in accordance with Article 99.
@ref Art 80(7) (src:1322)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the market surveillance authority is carrying out the evaluation under Article 80(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the market surveillance authority establishes that the AI system was misclassified by the provider as non-high-risk` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the AI system was misclassified in order to circumvent the application of requirements in Chapter III, Section 2` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 80(7) the provider is subject to fines in accordance with Article 99 for misclassification` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 80 to 98 and 101 and 112 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the AI system`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Article 113 gives this provision its date of application, and Article 111(2) may save the system; before that nothing is owed
    ELSE IF       `the market surveillance authority is carrying out the evaluation under Article 80(1)`
              AND `the market surveillance authority establishes that the AI system was misclassified by the provider as non-high-risk`
              AND `the AI system was misclassified in order to circumvent the application of requirements in Chapter III, Section 2`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where, in the course of the evaluation pursuant to paragraph 1 of this Article, the market surveillance authority establishes that the AI system was misclassified by the provider as non-high-risk in order to circumvent the application of requirements in Chapter III, Section 2, the provider shall be subject to fines" (a "where" condition that is not met; an unmet element of a named infringement: split site (i), fork F-80-7)

§ `Article 80(8): checks on the application of Article 80`

-- src:1323 | 8. In exercising their power to monitor the application of this Article, and in accordance with Article 11 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020, market surveillance authorities may perform appropriate checks, taking into account in particular information stored in the EU database referred to in Article 71 of this Regulation.
