GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the market surveillance authority is exercising its power to monitor the application of Article 80` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the checks are performed in accordance with Article 11 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 80(8) the market surveillance authority may perform appropriate checks` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 80 to 98 and 101 and 112 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the AI system`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Article 113 gives this provision its date of application, and Article 111(2) may save the system; before that nothing is owed
    ELSE IF       `the market surveillance authority is exercising its power to monitor the application of Article 80`
              AND `the checks are performed in accordance with Article 11 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020`
         THEN JUST TRUE  -- the information stored in the EU database referred to in Article 71 is to be taken into account "in particular"; it is not a condition
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the grant is "in exercising their power to monitor the application of this Article, and in accordance with Article 11 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020" (a grant limited by its own wording: the grant ruling, fork F-80-8)
